# Dhaka to Toronto Flight: Airlines, Ticket Prices and Complete Travel Guide

Travelling from Bangladesh to Canada is a major international journey, whether you are moving for higher education, starting a new job, visiting family or planning a holiday. Toronto is one of the most popular destinations for travellers departing from Dhaka, and choosing the right flight can make a significant difference to your travel experience.

If you are searching for a **Dhaka to Toronto flight**, it is worth comparing airlines, departure schedules, transit arrangements, baggage allowances and ticket prices before booking.

Several international airlines offer connections between Hazrat Shahjalal International Airport (DAC) and Toronto Pearson International Airport (YYZ). Biman Bangladesh Airlines also operates services on this route, with a scheduled stop in Rome.

This guide covers the main flight options, Biman Bangladesh services, Dhaka to Toronto air ticket prices, journey duration and practical booking advice.

